  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "In June 2026 remarks at an Amazon Web Services summit, CIA Director John Ratcliffe said the agency’s new Acquisition Framework and Procurement Executive aim to complete most acquisitions within six months. He described frontier AI models as potentially akin to “digital nuclear weapons” and said he made emerging technologies a top priority alongside China. Ratcliffe argued that the CIA cannot wait for a risk-free approach to emerging technology, must move fast and aggressively, and must master it better than adversaries. He said widespread AI adoption is transforming the agency’s work and that adversaries seek to steal and manipulate America’s advancements.",
   "sids": [
    "s1",
    "s2",
    "s5",
    "s3",
    "s4",
    "s6",
    "s7"
   ],
